1
00:00:00,793 --> 00:00:01,833
(Leonard:)What happened?

2
00:00:02,002 --> 00:00:05,462
(Penny:)Well, I went over to Mike's
to make up with him...

3
00:00:05,631 --> 00:00:07,631
Yeah, no, I know that part.

4
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:10,093
(Penny:)But he had already moved on.

5
00:00:10,469 --> 00:00:12,009
Already? That was quick.

6
00:00:12,179 --> 00:00:17,059
(Penny:)That's what I said to the woman
who had her legs wrapped around his neck.

7
00:00:19,311 --> 00:00:21,231
(Leonard:)Oh, Penny, I am so sorry.

8
00:00:21,397 --> 00:00:23,647
How could he do that?

9
00:00:23,816 --> 00:00:27,316
Oh, you know,
you did throw an 80-gig iPod...

10
00:00:27,486 --> 00:00:29,366
Yeah, no, how could he do that?

11
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:33,070
(Penny:)I swear to God,
I am done with guys like that.

12
00:00:33,242 --> 00:00:37,202
(Penny:)You know, macho with the perfect body,
and the hair and the money.

13
00:00:37,371 --> 00:00:39,711
(Leonard:)Yeah, that must get old quick.

14
00:00:40,249 --> 00:00:46,089
(Penny:)You know, just once, I would like to go out
with someone who is nice and honest...

15
00:00:46,255 --> 00:00:48,425
(Penny:)...and who actually cares about me.

16
00:00:48,757 --> 00:00:50,087
[WHIMPERS]

17
00:00:50,384 --> 00:00:51,424
(Leonard:)What about me?

18
00:00:52,303 --> 00:00:54,303
(Penny:)What about you what?

19
00:00:54,471 --> 00:00:56,261
[CRYING]

20
00:00:56,432 --> 00:01:01,022
(Leonard:)What about if you went out with me?

